*@
<p class="text-gray-400 text-sm border-t border-[#E8F1EF] pt-4">
    <span class="font-medium text-gray-500">In English:</span> To report a collection shared with you,
    open it in the app, tap <span class="font-medium">&quot;…&quot;</span> and choose
    <span class="font-medium">Report collection</span>; the same menu lets you block the person or remove
    the collection from your library. To report a public link, write to
    <a href="mailto:abuse@somineapp.com?subject=Content%20report%20—%20Somine" class="text-[#688E8B] hover:underline">abuse@somineapp.com</a>
    with the link and a short description. Every report is reviewed within 24 hours; confirmed
    violations are removed, public links are revoked and offending accounts are suspended.
    <a href="?lang=en" class="text-[#688E8B] hover:underline">Read this page in English.</a>
</p>
